2.—(1) In these Rules, unless the context otherwise requires —
“coupon parking place” has the meaning given by the Parking Places (Coupon Parking) Rules (R 3);
[Deleted by S 529/2026 wef 03/08/2026]
“identification mark” means the identification mark required by rule 17 of the Road Traffic (Motor Vehicles, Registration and Licensing) Rules (R 5) to be carried by a motor vehicle;
“in-vehicle unit” has the meaning given by the Road Traffic (Electronic Road Pricing System) Rules 2015 (G.N. No. S 226/2015);
“parking charge” means the parking charge fixed under section 9(1) of the Act;
“parking session”, for a vehicle, means, subject to paragraph (2), the period of time the vehicle is within a parking place;
“Parking.sg app” means a digital payment software application that —
(a)operates on mobile devices (such as smartphones and tablet computers); and
(b)is approved by the Superintendent for use to make digital payment of the parking charges for any parking session within a coupon parking place in accordance with rule 4;
[S 529/2026 wef 03/08/2026]
“Parking@HDB app” means a digital payment software application that —
(a)operates on mobile devices (such as smartphones and tablet computers); and
(b)is approved by the Superintendent for use to make digital payment of the parking charges for any parking session within a Parking@HDB parking place in accordance with rule 5;
[S 529/2026 wef 03/08/2026]
“Parking@HDB parking place” means a parking place that —
(a)is a parking place maintained or operated by the Housing and Development Board;
(b)is designated as such by the Superintendent, by placing or erecting at or near the parking place a sign bearing that name; and
(c)is not a coupon parking place;
“roadside electronic parking application” or “REP app” means a digital payment software application that —
(a)operates on the in-vehicle unit of a vehicle; and
(b)is approved by the Superintendent for use to make digital payment of the parking charges for any parking session within a coupon parking place in accordance with rule 4A;
[S 529/2026 wef 03/08/2026]
“vehicle” means a motor car, motor cycle or lorry.
(2) Where a vehicle is parked within a coupon parking place, then for the purposes of these Rules, the parking session of the vehicle —
(a)begins upon the entry of the vehicle into a parking lot; and
(b)ends upon the vehicle being removed from the parking lot.
